<title>UK: DG Hyp sets 1.0 billion mark three-year Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>DG Hyp sets 1.0 billion mark three-year Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Pfandbrief bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Commerzbank and DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE GENOSSENSCHAFTS HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    07.OCT.99</p>
